# Privacy — personal-data rights (Law No. 2297-VI): superadmin and admin (gate privacy-manage). Synthetic data only.
# Path ids below are placeholders — replace with real ids from a list call. {type} = candidate | employee.
@type = candidate
@id = 1
# Variables: see rest/http-client.env.json (host, session, xsrf). How to get them: docs/guides/api.md
# Full list of Privacy operations: /api/docs (tag "Privacy"). Page: docs/modules/privacy.md

### GET /api/privacy/settings — privacy.settings.show
GET {{host}}/api/privacy/settings
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

### PUT /api/privacy/settings — privacy.settings.update (retention_rejected_months: 1..120 or null = off)
PUT {{host}}/api/privacy/settings
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Referer: {{host}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "retention_rejected_months": 12
}

### GET /api/privacy/{type}/{id}/export — privacy.export (format=json|html)
GET {{host}}/api/privacy/{{type}}/{{id}}/export?format=json
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

### GET /api/privacy/{type}/{id}/requests — privacy.requests
GET {{host}}/api/privacy/{{type}}/{{id}}/requests
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

### POST /api/privacy/{type}/{id}/erase — privacy.erase (irreversible; reason 3..500, confirm accepted)
POST {{host}}/api/privacy/{{type}}/{{id}}/erase
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Referer: {{host}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Synthetic erase request",
  "confirm": true
}
